WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.275
Only a right angle makes the squares balance.

2
00:00:03.826 --> 00:00:08.176
At ninety degrees, nine and sixteen make exactly twenty-five.

3
00:00:08.977 --> 00:00:13.252
Open the angle and the long side's square grows past twenty-five.

4
00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:22.338
Close it below ninety and it shrinks: acute.
